---
import services from "../data/featuresData.json";
---

<section
  class="py-14 bg-white sm:py-16 lg:py-28"
  aria-labelledby="services-heading"
>
  <div class="px-4 mx-auto sm:px-6 lg:px-0 xl:max-w-7xl max-w-4xl">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-6">
        <div
          class="w-20 h-[2px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-indigo-600"
        >
        </div>
        <span
          class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600 uppercase tracking-widest"
          >Mis Servicios</span
        >
        <div
          class="w-20 h-[2px] bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent to-indigo-600"
        >
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2
        id="services-heading"
        class="text-2xl lg:text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl xl:text-5xl font-heading mb-3"
      >
        Tu Visión, Mi Código,
        <span
          class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-purple-600"
        >
          Resultados Excepcionales
        </span>
      </h2>

      <p
        class="text-base lg:text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600 font-body max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mt-0 mt-3"
      >
        Creo aplicaciones web que combinan <strong>diseño excepcional</strong> con
        <strong>tecnología robusta</strong>. <span class="ocultar-en-movil">
          Diseñadas específicamente para impulsar el crecimiento de tu negocio</span
        >
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-2 mt-8 text-center sm:mt-16 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-x-12 lg:gap-y-12 gap-x-5 px-2 lg:px-0 gap-y-8 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-0 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-5 xl:mt-20"
      role="list"
    >
      {
        services.map((service, index) => (
          <div
            class="md:py-4"
            role="listitem"
            aria-labelledby={`service-${index}-title`}
          >
            <svg
              class="mx-auto text-indigo-600 w-8 h-8 lg:w-10 lg:h-10"
              viewBox="0 0 46 46"
              fill="none"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <use href={`/featuresSprite.svg#${service.id}`} />
            </svg>
            <h3
              id={`service-${index}-title`}
              class="lg:mt-6 mt-2 text-md lg:text-xl  lg:font-bold text-gray-900 font-heading"
            >
              {service.title}
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1 lg:mt-4 text-sm lg:text-base text-gray-600 font-body px-3 w-[80%] text-center mx-auto ocultar-en-movil">
              {service.text}
            </p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ocultar-en-movil {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
